{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOLLS THE HUNT</strong> is a cooperative multiplayer survival horror game, where you enter a macabre world full of dangers. As a lost doll, you must explore unknown territories, face terrifying monsters, and deal with other players who can be temporary allies\u2026 or enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark universe, you take part in a deadly reality show, where every decision can mean the difference between life and death. Survive traps, solve puzzles, and use the environment to your advantage as you try to escape this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/extras/3f327f2939418c171d2a607066914563.poster.avif?t=1765674953\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/extras/3f327f2939418c171d2a607066914563.webm?t=1765674953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/extras/3f327f2939418c171d2a607066914563.mp4?t=1765674953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join private matches or public lobbies with up to 5 players. Have fun with friends or challenge players from around the world in tense, strategic matches. Try different game modes: become the hunter and chase all your friends, or try to escape while facing challenges in a cruel world, where your suffering is the entertainment of the reality show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/extras/fe7a0499442bce19b79bfd21c4a1bf23.poster.avif?t=1765674953\" width=800 height=381 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/extras/fe7a0499442bce19b79bfd21c4a1bf23.webm?t=1765674953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first or third person, switching perspectives for greater immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create public or private lobbies to play with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate via voice or text during matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark, detailed environments full of atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and interact with your friends!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3065180?t=1765674953","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/20fd01d0a30a8cf9c0de1377f8509aab9b4ed993/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765674953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/e8931136247d703892de5add07f003fb7460df6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765674953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065180/e8931136247d703892de5add07f003fb7460df6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765674953","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Warning: Adult content - This game contains implied nudity and scenes of violence, including murders."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4211550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D